{
  "$comment": "U-Net cell profile (science_profile 2, version 2): the U-Net mask gives the cells; per cell the host's outer-contour path (evaluateOuterContourObject) without ring features, plus the Contract 2 Laplacian variance. Decisions 2026-10-02 (docs/PZ7035_UNET_PIPELINE_PLAN.md on feat/unet-lut-dsp-split). Version 1 of this profile was the mask pixel count only. Reason code 4 (Ring) is unused. The channel-band gate is kept (user, 2026-10-02: U-Net blemishes near the walls).",
  "science_profile": 2,
  "profile_version": 2,
  "requires_abi": {
    "major": 1,
    "minor": 2
  },
  "requires_capabilities": [
    "PROFILE_PAGE",
    "TABLE_LOADER"
  ],
